TITLE Question simulation variant
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    units     mmol/kgw
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0 10
    Gypsum    0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 16
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g)   -0.0
    CH4(g)    0.6990
    H2S(g)    1.0000
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.txt
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
END
